---
import { CITY, GITHUB_URL, LANDING_PATH, waLink } from '../consts';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 bg-ink text-[#c9d3e3]">
	<div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]">
		<div class="max-w-sm">
			<Logo light />
			<p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed">
				Jasa migrasi dan perawatan aplikasi web PHP ke Laravel. Berbasis di {CITY}, melayani klien di seluruh
				Indonesia secara online.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Layanan</h2>
			<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[0.98rem]">
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href={LANDING_PATH}>Migrasi PHP ke Laravel</a></li>
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href={`${LANDING_PATH}#tahapan`}>Tahapan kerja</a></li>
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href={`${LANDING_PATH}#biaya`}>Cara menghitung biaya</a></li>
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/blog/">Artikel</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Hubungi</h2>
			<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[0.98rem]">
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href={waLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a></li>
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/tentang/">Tentang Sulih</a></li>
				<li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/kontak/">Halaman kontak</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="border-t border-[#2a3a5c]">
		<p class="wrap py-5 text-sm text-[#9fb0cc]">&copy; {year} Sulih. Dibangun dengan Astro.</p>
	</div>
</footer>
